OL,3,GNEWSAInquiry chair appointed over NHS
OL,4,Atrust failings
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe chair of a public inquiry into
OL,7,Fmental health care at an NHS trust has
OL,8,Fbeen named following months of delays.
OL,10,FHis Honour Judge John Potter was
OL,11,Fappointed chair of the probe into
OL,12,Fserious failings at the Tees, Esk and
OL,13,FWear Valleys NHS Foundation Trust
OL,14,F(TEWV).
OL,16,FFamilies, including those of teenagers
OL,17,FChristie Harnett, Nadia Sharif and
OL,18,FEmily Moore, who died by suicide
OL,19,Ffollowing care at the trust, previously
OL,20,Fsaid they were "in limbo" over the
OL,21,Fdelays.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,398,390,260,160,0,100
